Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 04:14:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] loadgen_perf_server: pace streams, inject failures, serve
 /v1/completions

The windowed-measurement tests need a server whose timing and failures are
fixed by construction. --prefill-delay-ms and --chunk-delay-ms pace the
stream segment by segment (zero keeps the single-write profiling path),
--fail-request-id-containing answers HTTP 500 to matching measured
requests, and /v1/completions serves the OpenAI-compatible shape of the
same stream so the openai backend can be exercised.

Also match the client's current preflight request id: the server still
expected the old name, so the preflight could never pass against it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DCNRKVzTz7MNsHuoM9wwFh
